The proposed answer confuses the year Gregor Mendel presented his lectures (and the volume year of the journal) with the actual year the paper was published. 

While Mendel read his paper to the Natural History Society of Brünn at two meetings in February and March of 1865, and the paper appeared in the journal's proceedings for the year 1865 (*Verhandlungen des naturforschenden Vereines in Brünn*, Bd. IV für das Jahr 1865), the volume itself was actually printed and published in **1866**.

